<title>USA: Pacific Sunwear January same store sales.</title>
<headline>Pacific Sunwear January same store sales.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Sunwear of California Inc said same store sales for the four weeks ended February 2 rose 34 percent, and total sales rose 63 percent to $7.5 million.</p>
<p>For the year ended February 2, same store sales rose 16 percent and total sales were up 38 percent to $155.3 million.</p>
